# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: a switch"
msgid "Gathering reminders"
msgstr "Recordatorios de encuentros"

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: a switch"
msgid "Letters"
msgstr "Cartas"

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: a switch"
msgid "Path emails"
msgstr "Correos del camino"

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: a switch"
msgid "Your notifications by email"
msgstr "Sus notificaciones por correo"

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: a switch's line"
msgid "A few emails that walk you along a path you chose, and the welcome for new members."
msgstr "Algunos correos que le acompañan por el camino que eligió, y la bienvenida para nuevos miembros."

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: a switch's line"
msgid "News from the village, sent only to the people who asked for it."
msgstr "Noticias de la aldea, enviadas solo a quienes las pidieron."

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: a switch's line"
msgid "Quests, roles, votes and messages. Your notification settings choose which ones."
msgstr "Misiones, roles, votaciones y mensajes. Sus ajustes de notificaciones eligen cuáles."

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: a switch's line"
msgid "Reminders and changes for the gatherings you said yes to."
msgstr "Recordatorios y cambios de los encuentros a los que dijo que sí."

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: the note at the foot"
msgid "Some email always goes, because you asked for it just then: a password link, or a confirmation of something you did."
msgstr "Algunos correos siempre se envían, porque usted los pidió en ese momento: un enlace de contraseña o la confirmación de algo que hizo."

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: why this address receives nothing"
msgid "A person at the village stopped email to this address. Ask them if you want it back."
msgstr "Una persona de la aldea detuvo el correo a esta dirección. Pídale que lo reactive si lo desea."

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: why this address receives nothing"
msgid "Email to this address stopped after one of our emails was marked as spam. Ask a person at the village if you want it back."
msgstr "El correo a esta dirección se detuvo porque uno de nuestros correos se marcó como spam. Pida a una persona de la aldea que lo reactive si lo desea."

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: why this address receives nothing"
msgid "Email to this address stopped because messages to it bounced. Ask a person at the village to start it again."
msgstr "El correo a esta dirección se detuvo porque los mensajes rebotaron. Pida a una persona de la aldea que lo reactive."

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: why this address receives nothing"
msgid "This address was erased from the village, so no email goes to it."
msgstr "Esta dirección se borró de la aldea, así que no se le envía ningún correo."

# needs-native-review: visitor pages, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "email preferences: why this address receives nothing"
msgid "You asked us to stop every email to this address."
msgstr "Usted nos pidió detener todo correo a esta dirección."

